OL,4,BSaliva should be used to shine ball    
OL,5,Bagain - Gill                           
OL,6,GIndia captain Shubman Gill says that   
OL,7,Gplayers should be allowed to use       
OL,8,Gsaliva to shine the ball again, six    
OL,9,Gyears after it was outlawed.           
OL,11,FThe ban was first introduced by the    
OL,12,FInternational Cricket Council (ICC) as 
OL,13,Fa result of the Covid-19 pandemic, in  
OL,14,FMay 2020, before being made permanent  
OL,15,Fin 2022.                               
OL,17,FSince then, players have been allowed  
OL,18,Fto use sweat to shine the ball because 
OL,19,Fthere was less risk of transmitting    
OL,20,Fthe Covid disease.                     
